sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform User
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as Batch Gateway Operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Helm as Helm Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant APIServer as API Server<br/>(managed Deployment)
    participant Processor as Processor<br/>(managed Deployment)
    participant AsyncProc as Async Processor<br/>(optional)
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>TCP Optional TLS
    participant InfGW as Inference Gateway<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>TCP Optional TLS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: LLMBatchGateway Reconciliation
        User->>K8sAPI: Create LLMBatchGateway CR
        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event (TLS 1.2+, SA token)
        Operator->>Helm: Render batch-gateway chart<br/>+ async-processor chart
        Helm-->>Operator: Rendered K8s objects
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply<br/>(Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps, etc.)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Status patch (conditions, observedGeneration)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Cross-Namespace Secret Resolution
        Operator->>K8sAPI: List ReferenceGrants in target namespace
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: ReferenceGrant permits access
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Get source Secret
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update {gw-name}-credentials<br/>in CR namespace
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 3: Batch Inference (Sync Dispatch)
        User->>APIServer: POST batch job<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, tenant header
        APIServer->>DB: Store job state<br/>TCP, credentials from secretRef
        Processor->>InfGW: Dispatch inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Optional TLS/mTLS
        Processor->>S3: Read/write batch files<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
        S3-->>Processor: File data
        InfGW-->>Processor: Inference result
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over User,Redis: Flow 4: Batch Inference (Async Dispatch)
        User->>APIServer: POST batch job<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        Processor->>Redis: Enqueue requests<br/>TCP, Optional TLS
        AsyncProc->>Redis: Dequeue requests<br/>TCP, Optional TLS
        AsyncProc->>InfGW: Dispatch to EPP<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Optional mTLS
        InfGW-->>AsyncProc: Inference result
        AsyncProc->>Redis: Store results<br/>TCP, Optional TLS
    end
